    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3417" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">archē</span></b> , ēs,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχή</span> (beginning).
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>One of the Æons of Valentinus</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Val.
			35</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Archē</span></b> , <i>one of the four muses; a daughter of the younger
				Jupiter</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 3, 21, 54</span></i>.</div>
